cc-mod-academic-harness
=======================

A Claude Code mod that runs the Academic Harness research tooling inside
Claude Code. It is a port, not a fork: the upstream project is read at a pinned
commit and never modified.

Upstream: Academic Harness (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 ResearchCraft),
https://github.com/raktim-mondol/academic-harness (read at a pinned commit). See UPSTREAM.lock.json for the pinned
commit once the snapshot exists (phase P1). Upstream's own NOTICE, which lists
the third-party skill catalogues and their licences, applies to every skill
this mod copies from it and is carried with them.

Code written for this mod is under the MIT License in LICENSE.
